{"summary":"The Deer God is a breathtaking 3D pixel art adventure","description":"The Deer God is a breathtaking 3D pixel art adventure that will challenge your religion \nand your platforming skills. \nIt's a game about survival, reincarnation, and karma; all set in a breathtaking and unique 3D pixelized world. \n\nFeast your eyes on the beautiful lighting, day and night system, and vast landscapes. \n\nBecome one of the most beautiful animals on planet earth. \n\nLIVE AS A DEER. \n\nSURVIVE AS A DEER. \n\nFeatures: \nGorgeous 3d pixel art world to explore \nVarious animals and characters to interact with \nNight and Day system \nVarious quests \nTons of items to find and use \nReincarnate into other animals \nUse the power of statues and level up your antlers \nFind secrets and solve ancient puzzles \nFollow an interesting and dark storyline \nAmazing Original Soundtrack by Evan Gipson.\n\nFollow us for the latest info and game news!\n\n• http://crescentmoongames.com/other-games/\n• https://facebook.com/crescentmoongames\n• https://twitter.com/cm_games","esrbNotes":"Violence, Mild Blood","pegiNotes":"Moderate Violence","iapPrices":null,"video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/crNmSAOc0YQ?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/bTQAP3A-b8147ipd2DrPCmE7cpbYFYW5UD_xl1SBU0pbGiVBl4b8LTYlGO3sVXIoK_yoErPtKy0JGOfEFEkq","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/RR2VHzzEmtuJFvfHn1U2LjGhl7xoZpDaa5OMgYweHh2tB1nbgS965ZHgMzuZFWbkiFAUpcfoYp83PQdPDUI7Cw","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/VTYtGT5UovsS89wnIeCeiokFXT7nRnGkhhQJTdAEUfUx1HnrHgMpw5AyjSLqgmu4VlUHAFSBiBtDyIdUSH3Feg","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/05gPBf3cYxnnLFs5SjYfx1c726Xo0zxeW5i3cCxWBtxVChB8lJBZPK0RbQML21UTdvZaOL1Dd8nNHWhGr0Wo","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/3-7T3ZvyLyTp1CVo0V47hXiZrJJpziWoKLT6_7MB1cRUm5HzNBBwAaqgVyYXIVUcGmQ2hvGR3R94Wat82yqqIXA","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/cAmw3IcZCMwgw2qzGvskMOukE9ralgshm7xXoa4kSZ6aAmTgTd6bPXGmJmnT